        "id": 1529242
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-12-13T19:53:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If I recall correctly (and I may not!) the AP sends the \"time since epoch\" down to the FPMCU (for all EC targets?) at startup so `get_time` should have a reasonable proxy for `now`. However, if queried before that time is set then the time may be reported from MCU starting",
